WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Narrator: Scene four. Noura sweeps the female toilets and the prayer room - one fan hadn't heard.

2
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.600
Noura: Evacuation - please leave now, this way.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.900
Narrator: She follows the last fan out and reports at the assembly point, including who's still being helped.

4
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:34.700
Noura: Block C clear, toilets and prayer room checked. One wheelchair user still inside at the refuge point, with Faisal.

